From 958b8bdca2f34b8e18e55855a503d1f1ccd9399b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Xing <fxing@qnx.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Oct 2025 11:00:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] qnx/libunwind: add qnx target support

Co-authored-by: Leo Shen <yishen@qnx.com>
---
